<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
{% include "_security.html" %}
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Mission Hangar</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
{% include "_hangar.css" %}
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% set root = "" %}{% set active = "home" %}{% include "_sitenav.html" %}
<header><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">DCS Missions · Caucasus · 2038</div>
  <h1>Mission Hangar</h1>
  <p>{{ campaigns | length }} campaigns and {{ missions | length }} ready-to-fly missions, each with a briefing, a slide deck and kneeboard pages. Start with a campaign, or pick a single mission below.</p>
</div></header>
<main>
<section class="wrap camps" id="campaigns" aria-labelledby="h-camps">
  <div class="cat-head"><h2 id="h-camps">Campaigns</h2><p>Story arcs flown in order. Each installs into DCS as a campaign that unlocks the next chapter when you pass the last.</p></div>
  <div class="grid">{% for c in campaigns %}
    <a class="camp" href="campaigns/{{ c.id }}/index.html">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ "Training campaign" if c.category == "training" else "Campaign" }} · {{ c.count }} chapters</span>
      <b>{{ c.title }}</b><span class="sub">{{ c.subtitle }}</span>
      <span class="prem">{{ c.premise }}</span>
      <span class="dates">{{ c.first }} → {{ c.last }}{% if c.setting %} · {{ c.setting }}{% endif %}</span>
    </a>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="h-single">
  <div class="cat-head"><h2 id="h-single">Single missions</h2><p>Fly these in any order.</p></div>
  <div class="tiles">
  {% for t in standalone %}
    <div class="tile">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ t.eyebrow }} · {{ t.missions | length }} missions</span>
      <h3><a href="missions.html#{{ t.key }}">{{ t.heading }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ t.blurb }}</p>
      <ul>{% for m in t.missions %}<li><a href="{{ m.id }}/briefing.html">{{ m.title }}</a><span>{{ m.role }} · {{ m.aircraft_type }}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      <a class="more" href="missions.html#{{ t.key }}">See them with filters →</a>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
    <div class="tile">
      <span class="eyebrow">Everything · {{ missions | length }} missions</span>
      <h3><a href="missions.html">All missions</a></h3>
      <p>The full library, grouped by campaign, with filters for aircraft, mission type and features, and a search across every story.</p>
      <a class="more" href="missions.html">Browse all missions →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap howto">
  <details>
    <summary>How to fly these</summary>
    <ol>
      <li><b>A single mission:</b> download its <code>.miz</code> into <code>Saved Games/DCS/Missions/</code> and open it from the Mission menu.</li>
      <li><b>A campaign:</b> copy its folder from <code>hangar/campaigns/</code> into <code>Saved Games/DCS/Missions/Campaigns/</code> and pick it from the Campaign menu.</li>
      <li>Read the briefing or present the slide deck before you fly. Pilots: don't open the director pages, they're spoilers.</li>
    </ol>
  </details>
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
